WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:06.460
I don't like hurting people.

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:08.900
Running through that building...

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:10.480
The Rush...

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.860
I never felt anything like it.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.020
You're a solder.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:15.520
You're built for that.

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:17.560
So what's the deal?

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:18.460
You just kill anybody

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:19.140
if they pay you enough?

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:21.280
Would you kill anyone if you were ordered to?

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:33.660
You slow us down

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:34.160
you're on your own.

